\/strong> Tumble dry low, or hang-dry for the longest life.<\/h5><h5><strong>Ironing:<\/strong> Cool iron inside-out if necessary. Do not iron directly on the printed decoration or artwork.<\/h5><h5><strong>Dry Cleaning:<\/strong> Do not dry clean.<\/h5>"}},"description":{"type":"description","disabled":true,"settings":{"header":"Product description"}},"tab":{"type":"tab","settings":{"header":"Shipping & Fulfillment Policy","content":"<p>At Triton Apparel, each order is prepared with care and shipped using the service we determine will provide the best combination of reliability, delivery time, and cost.<\/p><p>Standard Shipping Rates<\/p><p>Shipping charges are based on the merchandise subtotal after discounts and before applicable taxes.<\/p><p>$125.00+<\/p><p>FREE Standard Shipping<\/p><p>Free standard shipping applies to eligible orders with a merchandise subtotal of $125 or more after discounts and before taxes.<\/p><p>Shipping Carriers<\/p><p>Triton Apparel may ship orders using USPS, UPS, or FedEx. The carrier and service are selected based on the destination, package size, weight, and delivery requirements of the order.<\/p><p>Customers cannot select a specific carrier with Standard Shipping. Tracking information will be provided once the order has been prepared for shipment.<\/p><p>Production & Processing Time<\/p><p>Many Triton Apparel products are made to order. Product pages will identify applicable production or turnaround times.<\/p><p>Production time is separate from carrier transit time. An estimated two-week production time, for example, refers to the time required to produce and prepare the order and does not include the time the shipping carrier requires to deliver the package.<\/p><p>Orders containing multiple made-to-order products may be held and shipped together once the complete order is ready.<\/p><p><\/p><p>U.S. Shipping<\/p><p>The rates shown above are intended for standard shipping within the United States.<\/p><p>Orders requiring delivery outside Triton Apparel's standard shipping area should contact us before ordering to determine whether shipping is available and to obtain applicable rates.<\/p><p>Questions About Shipping?<\/p><p>If you have questions about shipping, need expedited delivery, or would like shipping for an item normally designated for pickup, please contact Triton Apparel through our Contact Us page before placing your order.<\/p>","content_page":""}}},"block_order":["details_list_MMdig8","care_instructions_dbVddw","description","tab"],"settings":{"container":"container","color_scheme":"","default_open":true,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":50,"custom_class":"","animations":"inherit"}},"product-recommendations":{"type":"product-recommendations","settings":{"container":"container-fluid","color_scheme":"","remove_params":false,"heading":"You Might Also Like","heading_size":"h3","text_align":"center","limit":8,"columns":4,"column_gap":30,"enable_slider":true,"show_pagination":false,"show_navigation":true,"use_scroll_mobile":true,"padding_top":50,"padding_bottom":0,"custom_class":"","animations":"inherit"}},"recent-viewed-products":{"type":"recent-viewed-products","disabled":true,"settings":{"container":"container-fluid","color_scheme":"","heading":"Recently Viewed Products","heading_size":"h3","text_align":"center","limit":8,"columns":4,"column_gap":30,"pcard_layout":"","pcard_image_ratio":"","show_vendor":false,"hide_title":false,"enable_slider":true,"show_pagination":false,"show_navigation":false,"mobile_disable_slider":false,"use_scroll_mobile":true,"item_gap_mobile":16,"padding_top":100,"padding_bottom":0,"custom_class":"","animations":"inherit"}},"product-features":{"type":"icon-box","blocks":{"d81fff7a-3f85-4706-ad65-adc28ba8f29f":{"type":"iconbox","settings":{"card_color_scheme":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/free-shipping_6874031.png","image_by_url":"","link":"","title":"Free Shipping","heading_size":"h4","description":"<p>Get complimentary ground shipping on every <br\